==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16 seconds<sup>300f~480f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 27.33~28 seconds<sup>820f~840f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] helps a lot as it takes down lots of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies so if you have her make sure to use her. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] should also help take care of Shadow Boxer K. Other [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] also do well due to the Dark enemies' high knockback count.

